  "turbojpeg_build (cargo --features turbojpeg, system libturbojpeg 3.2.0) gives a bit-identical model input; its residual max |dprob| is onnxruntime-CPU vs the PyTorch reference (row_probs.npz), not the front end.",
  "Latency = preprocessing + inference per image, measured inside the sandbox on this laptop CPU (20 logical cores, onnxruntime default threads, CPU affinity not permitted)."
